#: blocks/notice/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "AI Notice"
msgstr "AI-note"

#: blocks/notice/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Disclosure note for AI-written text, as the EU AI Act asks for: a block, an "
"inline note, a dismissible banner, a badge or a button that opens a dialog, "
"with the wording from the TransparAI settings. Shows only when the post has "
"an AI level."
msgstr ""
"Oplysningsnote for AI-skrevet tekst, som EU AI Act kræver: en blok, en "
"inline-note, et banner, der kan lukkes, et badge eller en knap, der åbner en"
" dialog, med formuleringen fra TransparAI-indstillingerne. Vises kun, når "
"indlægget har et AI-niveau."

#: blocks/notice/block.json blocks/systems-notice/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "transparency"
msgstr "gennemsigtighed"

#: blocks/systems-list/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "AI Systems List"
msgstr "AI-systemliste"

#: blocks/systems-list/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"A list of the AI systems marked as visible in the TransparAI registry, each "
"with its category. The building block for an AI transparency statement, kept"
" in sync with the registry: a system you add or hide appears or disappears "
"on every page that carries the list."
msgstr ""
"En liste over de AI-systemer, der er markeret som synlige i TransparAI-"
"registret, hver med sin kategori. Byggestenen til en AI-"
"gennemsigtighedserklæring, holdt synkroniseret med registret: et system, du "
"tilføjer eller skjuler, vises eller forsvinder på hver side, der bærer "
"listen."

#: blocks/systems-list/block.json blocks/systems-notice/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "ai systems"
msgstr "ai-systemer"

#: blocks/systems-list/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "transparency statement"
msgstr "gennemsigtighedserklæring"

#: blocks/systems-list/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "registry"
msgstr "register"

#: blocks/systems-list/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "list"
msgstr "liste"

#: blocks/systems-notice/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "AI Systems Notice"
msgstr "AI-systemnote"

#: blocks/systems-notice/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"One sentence naming the AI systems this site uses, taken from the TransparAI"
" registry: chatbots, recommendations, image generation, translation. For the"
" imprint, the privacy policy or a transparency page. Shows only when at "
"least one system is marked as visible."
msgstr ""
"Én sætning, der nævner de AI-systemer, dette websted bruger, hentet fra "
"TransparAI-registret: chatbots, anbefalinger, billedgenerering, "
"oversættelse. Til kolofonen, privatlivspolitikken eller en "
"gennemsigtighedsside. Vises kun, når mindst ét system er markeret som "
"synligt."

#: blocks/systems-notice/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "privacy policy"
msgstr "privatlivspolitik"

#: blocks/systems-notice/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "imprint"
msgstr "kolofon"
